{"prototypeToken":{"displayName":20,"displayBars":20,"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":true}},"height":1,"width":1,"name":"Goblin Circus Troupe","actorLink":false,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/tokens/goblin-circus-troupe.webp","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"tint":"#ffffff","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1},"negative":false,"priority":0},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/subjects/goblin-circus-troupe.webp"}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"depth":1},"name":"Goblin Circus Troupe","type":"npc","effects":[],"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":90,"temp":0,"max":90,"details":"(16 squares), Thresholds 60 (12 squares), 30 (8 squares)"},"ac":{"value":23,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":25,"otherSpeeds":[],"details":"troop movement"},"weaknesses":[{"type":"area-damage","value":10,"exceptions":[]},{"type":"splash-damage","value":5,"exceptions":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["goblin"],"details":""},"level":{"value":6},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Goblin acrobats, bomb jugglers, fire eaters, dog tamers, clowns, and musicians form a goblin circus troupe led by a ringmaster. When left to their own devices, the troupe leaps and cartwheels around, banging their instruments and making an awful noise. Anyone who doesn't applaud loudly enough—and the troupe can't hear much over their din—gets pelted with whatever the goblins have on hand, which usually includes bombs and random circus props.</p>\n<p>With their courage bolstered by their numbers, goblin circus troupes love to perform in densely populated human cities where the city watch has difficulty keeping them under control.</p>\n<h2>Culture Shock</h2>\n<p>The number one piece of guidance for those about to experience a goblin circus troupe is: do NOT pelt the troupe with rotten vegetables. Goblin culture considers this expression of displeasure to be a sign of approval instead. Excited troupe members may be so thrilled by the audience participation that they bring offenders into the act. These kidnappings have put a new spin on the concept of running away to join the circus.</p>\n<h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2>\n<p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 30/65/125 gp</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning), armor (light), perception item, skill items (Acrobatics, Athletics, Nature, Performance)</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> constitution, dexterity, energy resistant (positive), mental, strength, wild</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Strange and Unusual","authors":"Rodney Sloan","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"creatureType":""},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":4},"dex":{"mod":6},"con":{"mod":4},"int":{"mod":1},"wis":{"mod":1},"cha":{"mod":2}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":11,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":14,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":17,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":11,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":13},"athletics":{"base":13},"nature":{"base":11},"performance":{"base":14}},"traits":{"value":["chaotic","evil","goblin","humanoid","troop"],"rarity":"common","size":{"value":"grg"}}},"img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/Portraits/goblin-circus-troupe.webp","items":[{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Darkvision","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Darkvision]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"darkvision","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688310930811,"modifiedTime":1688310930811,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.qCCLZhnp2HhP3Ex6","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"K6afWRoLNFA8E7Jd"},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Cavorting Tide","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The goblin circus troupe is less organized than most troops. It can move into other creatures' spaces, and other creatures can move into its spaces. Its spaces are difficult terrain to other creatures.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"7msfBu7h4GG0QZE6","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688310939584,"modifiedTime":1688310963155,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Troop Defenses","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.TroopDefenses]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"troop-defenses","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary 3","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688311018247,"modifiedTime":1688311018247,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.RJbI07QSiYp0SF9A","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"gLlsSleXWoc0pGFw"},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Cacophonous Aura","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>30 feet. Whenever a living creature within the aura starts its turn, the creature must attempt a @Check[type:will|dc:21] save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is immune to this ability for 1 hour.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Stupefied]{Stupefied 2} until the end of its next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is stupefied 2 for 1 minute.</p>"},"rules":[{"key":"Aura","radius":30}],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["auditory","aura","mental"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"y3mbbScJVmBraGZL","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688311026722,"modifiedTime":1688311064507,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Encore!","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> No enemy is within 10 feet of the goblin circus troupe.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The goblin circus troupe puts on the show of their lives. Creatures within 120 feet that can see and hear the goblin circus troupe must attempt a @Check[type:will|dc:24] save.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Fascinated]{Fascinated} by the goblin circus troupe for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is fascinated by the cavorting troupe and @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Stupefied]{Stupefied 2} for 1 minute.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["auditory","mental","visual"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"m0judjFjBv1hpygd","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688311080174,"modifiedTime":1688311111529,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","name":"Form Up","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.FormUp]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"form-up","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary 3","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688311118108,"modifiedTime":1688311118108,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.OvqohW9YuahnFaiX","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"70jSP23z0u159zlX"},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Pelt Them!","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The goblin circus troupe pelt their target with a volley of stones, bombs, and random props. This volley is a @Template[type:burst|distance:10] with a range of 30 feet that deals @Damage[2d8[bludgeoning],2d4[fire]]{2d8 bludgeoning damage and 2d4 fire} damage (@Check[type:reflex|dc:21|basic:true] save). When the goblin circus troupe is reduced to 8 or fewer squares, this area decreases to a @Template[type:burst|distance:5].</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"dTvuSU21gYTWuPxn","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688311124386,"modifiedTime":1691261013777,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Smash Them!","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The goblin circus troupe engages in a coordinated attack against each enemy in their squares and within 5 feet (@Check[type:reflex|dc:21|basic:true] save). The damage depends on the number of actions.</p>\n<p><span class=\"pf2-icon\">1</span> @Damage[1d8[bludgeoning],1d4[fire]]{1d8 bludgeoning damage and 1d4 fire} damage</p>\n<p><span class=\"pf2-icon\">2</span> [[/r (1d8+7)[bludgeoning],1d4[fire]]]{1d8+7 bludgeoning damage and 1d4 fire} damage</p>\n<p><span class=\"pf2-icon\">3</span> [[/r (1d8+11)[bludgeoning],1d4[fire]]]{1d8+11 bludgeoning damage and 1d4 fire} damage</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"frequency":{"max":1,"per":"round"}},"effects":[],"_id":"AmXYaWVJKTAM9ZQ8","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688311276331,"modifiedTime":1691261013792,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Troop Movement","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Whenever the goblin circus troupe Strides, the troupe first Forms Up as a free action to condense into a 20-foot-by-20-foot area (minus any missing squares), then moves. This works just like a Gargantuan creature moving; for instance, if any square of the troupe enters difficult terrain, the extra movement cost applies to the whole troupe.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"QIhqq2lxxA1Vnubm","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688311465139,"modifiedTime":1688311482903,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}],"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"6.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1685401626117,"modifiedTime":1736542897189,"lastModifiedBy":"l2rbNx2a8f5ocpeL","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"eaN9KXpgG02p3tqH","folder":"rnSyamM9GQTIpuOo","ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"sort":5200000}